### FASE 4 · Perfil del vecino (María Quispe). Primero ingresa con requests/auth.http o con estos dos pasos.
@base = http://localhost:8080

POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/otp/request
Content-Type: application/json

{ "phone": "987654321" }

###
# @name login
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/otp/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{ "phone": "987654321", "code": "123456" }

### Mi perfil (effectiveMode = modo que la app debe mostrar)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Cambiar mi nombre
PUT {{base}}/api/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "María Quispe" }

### Mi ubicación -> asigna la Zona 3 · Las Flores (fuera de cobertura: 422 ZONE_NOT_COVERED)
PUT {{base}}/api/v1/me/location
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "lat": -11.9790, "lng": -77.0030, "addressText": "Jr. Las Flores 120" }

### Contactos de confianza (máximo 3)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/me/trusted-contacts
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

###
PUT {{base}}/api/v1/me/trusted-contacts
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "name": "Mamá", "phone": "987000120", "position": 1 },
  { "name": "Carlos", "phone": "956000447", "position": 2 },
  { "name": "Sra. Rosa", "phone": "944000908", "position": 3 }
]

### Ficha médica (solo la ves tú; la brigada solo durante un SOS)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/me/medical-card
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

###
PUT {{base}}/api/v1/me/medical-card
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bloodType": "O+", "allergies": "Penicilina", "conditions": null, "livesWith": ["ELDERLY"] }

### Token de notificaciones del teléfono -> 204
PUT {{base}}/api/v1/me/device-token
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "fcm-token-de-prueba", "platform": "ANDROID" }

### Lo que la IA aprendió de mí (se llena en la FASE 9)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/me/ai-learnings
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Retirar el consentimiento de IA (borra lo aprendido)
PUT {{base}}/api/v1/me/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "aiConsent": true }

### "Prepara tu casa" (El Niño)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/me/prep-checklist
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

###
PUT {{base}}/api/v1/me/prep-checklist
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[ { "itemKey": "GO_BAG", "done": true }, { "itemKey": "SAFE_POINT", "done": true } ]

### Brigada: ficha médica de una persona (403 si no tiene SOS activo ni reporte abierto)
# Ingresa como 999000111 y reemplaza el id.
GET {{base}}/api/v1/brigade/medical-cards/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
